                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The artifact is a clean but slight, short puzzler that isn't a walking sim... but more like a click and walk a la Google street view. It was about an hour and the puzzles were not very difficult and presented in a very linear fashion. It's an enjoyable enough experience, but is only a simple one time journey, therefore for the price of $8 I think that's steep. I'm going to not recommend it because of that, but if you catch a sale and want a quick hit small adventure, you could def do worse.",
